                                                "sense_id": "93741c67-7bbb-3ff5-987c-9daa03bdf417",
                                                "text": "Will demand be in the same form as pre-COVID? Some will argue that now people have learned to teleconference, the creative joy of home-based working won't be given up lightly. Newton developed his Laws while self-isolating from plague."
                                            }
